### Models ###
# The Random Forest model and the shared StandardScaler are small enough to
# ship, and are what the deployed Streamlit app loads. The SVM is 500MB+ —
# too large for git and for Streamlit Community Cloud's free-tier memory —
# so it stays local-only; train it with `python -m src.train` if you want it
# available in the app's model picker when running locally.
models/SupportVectorClassifier.pkl
